# DRC-HALO-2: drc *halo 2 with a 5-unit spacing rule; violations 4 apart, flat and across the hierarchy.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load child
box 0 0 10 10
paint m1
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell child
box 14 0 24 10
paint m1
box 50 0 60 10
paint m1
box 64 0 74 10
paint m1
drc *halo 2
drc *halo
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
writeall force
